{"type":"message","id":"7fbccb44","parentId":"b15675a7","timestamp":"2026-03-02T03:40:23.162Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"任务已完成。让我总结一下成果并向主代理汇报。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"## ✅ 任务完成\n\n### 📦 交付物\n\n**项目位置**: `/home/one/.openclaw/agents/main/workspace/shared/artifacts/timer-tool/`\n\n**文件结构**:\n```\ntimer-tool/\n├── package.json     # 项目配置，依赖 commander.js\n├── index.js         # 主程序 (~4.7KB)\n├── test.js          # 测试脚本\n└── README.md        # 使用文档\n```\n\n### 🎯 实现功能\n\n| 命令 | 功能 |\n|------|------|\n| `timer start <seconds>` | 开始倒计时（后台运行） |\n| `timer stop` | 停止计时器 |\n| `timer status` | 查看剩余时间 |\n\n### ✨ 特性\n\n- **后台运行**: 计时器在后台运行，关闭终端也不影响\n- **跨平台通知**: 支持 macOS/Linux/Windows 桌面通知\n- **进程管理**: 使用 PID 文件防止重复启动\n- **状态查询**: 随时查看剩余时间\n\n### ✅ 测试结果\n\n```\n🧪 Timer CLI Tests\n\n✅ Help command displays usage\n✅ Start command validates input\n✅ Timer start creates PID file\n✅ Timer stop removes PID file\n✅ Status shows no timer when stopped\n\n📊 Results: 5/5 tests passed\n```\n\n### 📋 技术选型\n\n- **CLI框架**: `commander.js` - Node.js CLI 最佳实践推荐\n- **进程管理**: 使用 `spawn` 创建分离的后台进程\n- **通知系统**: \n  - macOS: `osascript`\n  - Linux: `notify-send`\n  - Windows: PowerShell MessageBox\n\n### 🚀 使用方法\n\n```bash\ncd /home/one/.openclaw/agents/main/workspace/shared/artifacts/timer-tool\nnpm install\nnpm link  # 全局安装 timer 命令\n\n# 使用\ntimer start 60   # 1分钟倒计时\ntimer status     # 查看状态\ntimer stop       # 停止计时器\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"bailian","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":387,"output":477,"cacheRead":17712,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18576,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1772422810741}}
